The educational tool developed by the leading IT company in the Baltics — TietoEVRY Latvia — is designed for preschool, first and second grade schoolchildren to learn mathematics, as well as to develop mathematical understanding, skills and strengthen the knowledge base acquired at school. 

The tasks included in the application are developed based on recommendations by the National Centre for Education and grouped thematically, offering children an opportunity to:
• learn and recognise numbers;
• learn how to draw numbers;
• develop spatial sense;
• recognise geometric shapes and colours;
• develop logical thinking;
• add and subtract;
• multiply and divide; 
• solve word problems.

Tigro Chat app - installed on your child's phone, synchronizes with the Kid Security app

Tigro Sirius Chat is designed for the safety of schoolchildren. The parent installs the application on the child's phone to always know where he is!

In the app, the you can:
- communicate with the parent in a chat;
- complete tasks, collect coins and spend them on your dream;
- receive audio notifications from the parent in the phone mode " without sound»;
- play quizzes and win prizes.

Tigro Sirius Chat DOES NOT allow parents to:
- read personal conversations in SMS, messengers and social networks
- listen to conversations on the phone
